    "description": {
      "value": "Sovereign steel armor sickens certain creatures that touch it. A creature with weakness to cold iron (generic) that critically fails an unarmed attack against a creature in sovereign steel armor becomes sickened 1, and such a creature is sickened 1 as long as it wears sovereign steel armor. The noqual (generic) in sovereign steel armor provides protection against magic, granting you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC against spell attack rolls. If you Cast a Spell while wearing sovereign steel armor, you must succeed at a DC 5 flat check or the spell fails.\n\nCraft Requirements: at least 150 gp of cold iron (generic) + 15 gp per Bulk plus at least 150 gp of noqual (generic) + 15 gp per Bulk."
    },
